<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Verify your Samaa account</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f4f4;
        color: #333;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 20px auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 8px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }
      .header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d3b2e 0%, #1a5c47 100%);
        color: #ffffff;
        padding: 40px 20px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .header .brand {
        font-size: 13px;
        letter-spacing: 3px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        opacity: 0.7;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }
      .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .header p {
        margin-top: 10px;
        font-size: 14px;
        opacity: 0.85;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 36px 30px;
      }
      .greeting {
        font-size: 17px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #0d3b2e;
      }
      .info-box {
        background-color: #f0f7f4;
        border-left: 4px solid #0d3b2e;
        padding: 18px 20px;
        margin: 24px 0;
        border-radius: 4px;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: #444;
      }
      .verify-button {
        display: inline-block;
        margin: 10px auto 20px;
        padding: 16px 44px;
        background-color: #c8960c;
        color: #ffffff !important;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 16px;
        text-align: center;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      }
      .link-fallback {
        margin: 20px 0;
        padding: 14px 16px;
        background-color: #f8f9fa;
        border-radius: 4px;
        border: 1px solid #dee2e6;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #6c757d;
        word-break: break-all;
      }
      .link-fallback strong {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
        color: #495057;
      }
      .expiry-note {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #888;
        margin-top: 6px;
      }
      .footer {
        background-color: #f8f9fa;
        padding: 20px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #6c757d;
        border-top: 1px solid #e9ecef;
      }
      .footer a {
        color: #0d3b2e;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 500;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <div class="brand">Samaa · سماع</div>
        <h1>Verify your email</h1>
        <p>One last step to activate your account</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <div class="greeting">Hello <%= displayName %>,</div>

        <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #444">
          Thank you for joining <strong>Samaa</strong>. Please confirm your
          email address to activate your account and start discovering Quranic
          reciters.
        </p>

        <div class="info-box">
          This verification link is valid for <strong>24 hours</strong>. After
          that, you can request a new one from your account settings.
        </div>

        <div style="text-align: center; margin: 32px 0">
          <a href="<%= VERIFY_URL %>" class="verify-button"
            >Verify my email address</a
          >
          <p class="expiry-note">Expires in 24 hours</p>
        </div>

        <div class="link-fallback">
          <strong>Button not working? Copy this link into your browser:</strong>
          <%= VERIFY_URL %>
        </div>

        <p
          style="
            margin-top: 28px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.6;
          "
        >
          If you did not create a Samaa account, you can safely ignore this
          email.
        </p>

        <p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 15px">
          Jazakum Allahu Khayran,<br />
          <strong>The Samaa Team</strong>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>© <%= YEAR %> Samaa. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p>This email was sent automatically, please do not reply.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
